  "question": {
    "text": "Two forces <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> whose magnitude are in the ratio <math><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> give a resultant of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>28</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>N</mtext></math>. If the angle of their inclination is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo></msup><mo>,</mo></math> then the magnitude of force <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> will be ----- <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "20.00",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> be the two forces.<br /><br />Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>°</mo></mrow></msup></math> .<br /><br />We know that <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>°</mo></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, force <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mtext>N</mtext></math>"
  }
